  "description": "The word \"Imaemangryang\" refers to all the monsters of the world. \"Seobang,\" the Imaemangryang who protected Jeongjo, sets out to prevent a disaster that has awakened after 300 years. To do so, he must protect \"Han Yu-Jeong,\" a woman with mysterious powers...\n\nA bloody battle begins between Imaemangryang, who have adapted to the modern world, including goblins, maegoo, Jangsanbeom, and Du-eoksini.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
